### Login ADMIN_MASTER
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@amparo.com",
  "senha": "admin123"
}

### Criar usuário enfermeiro
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Enfermeira",
  "email": "maria.enfermeira@amparo.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "ENFERMEIRO"
}

### Criar usuário administrador
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Administrador Local",
  "email": "admin.local@amparo.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "ADMIN"
}

### Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI

### Listar usuários enfermeiros
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios?perfil=ENFERMEIRO
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI

### Buscar usuário por ID
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI

### Atualizar usuário
PUT http://localhost:3000/usuarios/2
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Enfermeira Atualizada",
  "email": "maria.enfermeira@amparo.com",
  "perfil": "ENFERMEIRO"
}

### Desativar usuário
PATCH http://localhost:3000/usuarios/2/status
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ativo": false
}

### Ativar usuário
PATCH http://localhost:3000/usuarios/2/status
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ativo": true
}

### Erro: email duplicado
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Duplicado",
  "email": "maria.enfermeira@amparo.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "ENFERMEIRO"
}

### Erro: email inválido
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Email Inválido",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "senha": "123456",
  "perfil": "ENFERMEIRO"
}

### Erro: senha curta
POST http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer COLE_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Senha Curta",
  "email": "senha.curta@amparo.com",
  "senha": "123",
  "perfil": "ENFERMEIRO"
}

### Erro: sem token
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios

### Erro: token inválido
GET http://localhost:3000/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido